Overview:

This repository is a flutter federated plugin/library that handling biometric authentication related

Capabilities:
- Strong biometric authentication
- Split biometric authentication into two different process (registration & authentication)
- check whether device credential is set
- check biometric is enrolled
- check face auth is support
- check whether device is comply with biometric, face auth, or etc.

Rules:
- Use clean architecture & SOLID principle
- this library project contain a specific directory for platform, android, ios
- ensure code is testable
- keep public api is simple
- using pigeon for native communication
- there is (core, internal, api, model, enum, exception) directory for this library project
- api can depends on core, internal, model, enum, exception
- internal can depends on core, model, enum, exception
- core, model, enum, and exception is independent
- keep all public api function, model, enum, or exception have their own comment
- ensure exception have a code


Documentation:
- Use README.md for documentation
- ensure all of mark_android, mark_biometric, mark_ios, mark_platform_interface, have their own README.md
- add the simple minimal example for every public API function
- list exception that probably happen

After Agent Perform:
- Update README.md
- Ensure to notes if any breaking changes in README.md